		<p class="Tablefootnotef" style="margin-top: 0in;  border: none; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: -5pt; margin-left: 24.0pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24.0pt; padding: 0in; font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPSStd-Regular; color: black;">____________</p><p class="Tablefootnote_f" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:10pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;">(1)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>Depreciation expense was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27118">40,959</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27119">34,833</ix:nonFraction> for the six&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(2)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>In October&#160;2022, EXTEND disposed one building and associated land in Tokyo, Japan for which the carrying value was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c120" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentSalvageValue" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27120">437,967</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c121" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentSalvageValue" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27121">1,328,798</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. EXTEND received proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c122" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisposals" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27122">1,963,268</ix:nonFraction> from the disposal, net off commission fees paid to agents, resulting in disposal gain of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c122" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnDispositionOfAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27123">196,503</ix:nonFraction>.</p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(3)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-118"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-119">No</span></span> impairment loss was recognized for the six&#160;months ended March&#160;31, 2024 and for the&#160;year ended September&#160;30, 2023.</p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(4)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>As of March&#160;31, 2024, a vehicle, owned by Chuancheng Digital, for which the carrying value was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c123" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentSalvageValue" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27124">100,497</ix:nonFraction>, was pledged to secure a long<span class="nobreak">-term</span> loan from a financial institution.</p></ix:nonNumeric>
